[{"client_msg_id":"5afd24f3-3cdf-424e-813f-e75964d3b3fb","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"勝手にマージすると危険だからです","ts":"1637763190.282800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+XSAJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"310f4787-c598-4784-9e07-e0336033f259","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なぜかというとftdetectがまだロードされてないプラグインの関数を呼ぶかもしれなくて","ts":"1637763181.282500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AdHV2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc165279-3feb-40a6-ac07-b695925b8d15","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確認しました。merge_ftdetectが必要なのは仕様です","ts":"1637763153.281600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z4k6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70463415-e3a4-4a52-b490-4043c9ed6782","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"merge_ftdetect書けばとりあえず動くっぽいです","ts":"1637760518.281000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6hG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d07f7956-3b8f-4ee2-8635-96ce47cfbf26","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確認します","ts":"1637760103.280600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K+R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeb780d2-cd23-409e-9f48-45484f1bf9d5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"deinでon_ftしててftdetectが効かないのって`merge_ftdetect` を書くのが適切であってるでしょうか\n以前動いてたんですけど `merged: 0` を設定してたときな気がしていてあってるのか確信が持てず\n一応プラグインはこれです \u003chttps://github.com/pantharshit00/vim-prisma\u003e","ts":"1637759725.280200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"pantharshit00/vim-prisma","id":1,"title":"pantharshit00/vim-prisma","text":"Prisma 2 support for vim","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"60","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gqTt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a738aa1b-bc5b-4c92-b2a1-db5ec7a389e7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ですねー","ts":"1637686508.276100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BlG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c1a0acc-5899-4dbc-aea6-3f67d543bec0","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"つまりはプラグインのハイライト設定は `plugin/xxx.vim` を読んだ時点で定義を読み込ませるのが正しくて、`ColorScheme` で再読み込みするのはどこかで `colorscheme` されたときの保険ですね。","ts":"1637686474.275800","edited":{"user":"U01E2DL1U22","ts":"1637686495.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u1+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60e85055-095e-49de-97c8-7c5d10487604","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"カラースキームと言っても所詮(というのもあれか)ただのVim scriptなので","ts":"1637686368.274400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CQ6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7b33f21-59bf-4013-87e9-39ea1fc42b02","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"行儀が悪いカラースキームはclearしないのでバグる(何度か見たことがある)","ts":"1637686335.272900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6qS4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8351903-037e-4f1a-9f32-99a432a99e80","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"`colorscheme` されると全ての highlight 定義 が吹っ飛ぶのは仕様というかカラースキーマを作るときは最初に `highlight clear` する習わしがあるって感じですね。","ts":"1637686281.271900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01J8RHFH3P"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aq1Ps"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3fb164b-0ddb-405b-b07f-ac636224b9c7","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"`colorscheme` されると全ての highlight 定義 が吹っ飛ぶ？？みたいなので、そのための安全装置として autocmd に `ColorScheme` でハイライト定義の再読み込みを仕込むわけで、初めから `ColorScheme` が発火することを前提と期待する方が間違っていました。","ts":"1637686177.270500","edited":{"user":"U01E2DL1U22","ts":"1637686275.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UMn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad0b7c73-bfa3-446f-9237-6a23b4fde853","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"`has('gui_running')` でGUIで起動したか判定できるので、個人的には.vimrcに一本化してしまうのが楽かと思いますね。","ts":"1637685514.267700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5SRb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebc62361-e6af-45a4-83a8-0705f33bfa0a","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"いや、vimrc で colorscheme を読んだ後、gvimrc で再び colorscheme を実行していたから問題に気が付かなかったのですが、gvimrc は大体のプラグインが読み込まれた後最後の方で読んでいるみたいですね","ts":"1637685449.266700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sj74E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd69c335-0a35-44f1-be6f-f3c7f0f3a79f","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":".vimrcと.gvimrcの読み込み順番？","ts":"1637685369.265400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EM="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccd012b3-3cdd-40c5-8afd-9737d52473b8","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"gvim と vim で colorscheme の読込タイミングが違うのかな？？","ts":"1637685318.264500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2FB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bdd9b05-ee54-4cc3-8bdb-53370b909fdb","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"まさにそれですね。\nそして、プラグインがハイライトを提供する場合、だいたいすでに `colorscheme` コマンド実行し終わっていると思いますが、その場合都度ハイライトをさせるしかなさそうですね‥","ts":"1637685239.263400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bV/zy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5437e34-ff81-4776-b9aa-a44984e2e058","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"autocmd ColorSchemeで定義したコマンドはcolorscheme時に発火するので、colorschemeの前でautocmd ColorSchemeをしておかないと意味ないです","ts":"1637685020.261600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5/ew"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc374e99-244b-458a-bee7-2a596b6edfca","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"colorschemeのあとにautocmd ColorSchemeの定義をしているとかかな","ts":"1637684931.260500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mf31"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a85519d-a4fd-45e3-abf4-9a1fc55c78e7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"設定ファイルを晒すと解決が早くなります","ts":"1637684462.259900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"grsF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2352b352-2dcf-4861-bcfa-f564b349296c","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"gvimrc で定義してる何かが抜けてるとか","ts":"1637684439.259600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bZMr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8201d05d-a84b-4726-b226-6d06296d156a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"定義間違っているとかじゃないでしょうか(パターン抜けてたりとかよくやらかす)","ts":"1637683542.258400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Odu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfa876ea-b27c-482b-aa93-db617cecb7e9","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"環境問題？","ts":"1637683540.258300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9BY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bc1a0d0-172e-4c69-ac3d-07a77c54effa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"発火しますね","ts":"1637683502.256800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oZeWw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67a52d82-e326-47f9-8946-a41198f23ef2","type":"message","user":"U01E2DL1U22","text":"こんにちは。\ngvim ではない方の、CUI の方の vim は起動時に `ColorScheme` の自動コマンドは発火しないのですか？\n`ColorScheme` 自動コマンドで設定した `:highlight` 定義が読ませられなくて困っています。","ts":"1637683469.256400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kaf"}]}]
